{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把满足暂时退到背景、让尚未满足的需要浮现出来，是对 M2 及 H2、H4、H7、H10 的局部因果展开，没有新增事件，也没有把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"由 H6 的时间意识、H11 对快乐流逝的心疼以及 H2、H7、H10 对关系和感受的限定，推导出短暂的确认冲动与留在心里的疑问，且明确没有断言他否定了幸福或实际向对方发问，仍然围绕原有主线展开。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"将身体先于明确念头松动解释为承受强度后的自然抽离，直接接上 M27，并由 H5、H9、H10、H11 支撑，没有增加新的前史或外部事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条都明确写出了当下的感受及其心理成因，即使不看听感记录，也能读懂从满足退去、意识到时间流逝到逐渐放松的情绪变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "770b987e-1fc0-4314-b521-4417fb123d94", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134029974691Z", "elapsed_seconds": 281.484, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:45:11.474878+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c516a9270cd2a01b56afec74e15bd9119ccc7d08c7e414e0b08437adf2909528", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06